    "created_at": "2015-11-24T09:21:31Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-11-24T09:21:31Z",
    "body": "I think we should just return the qualified names, those are the property names NamedNodeMap already exposes and what most algorithms operate on.\n\nIf you just stick to namespaceless attributes as you should, there will be no issue.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
